  // NOTE: pill_taken intentionally omitted — _turn_log is injected into the
  // prompt via [TURN MEMORY], and we do NOT want the model seeing backend
  // pill color identifiers in its own memory trail. The narrative line for
  // that turn already describes the transformation in-fiction.
